\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God is working His purpose out, 
\par as year succeeds to year
\par God is working His purpose out, 
\par and the time is drawing near-
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Nearer and nearer draws the time- 
\par the time that shall surely be,
\par When the earth shall be filled with 
\par the glory of God, as the waters 
\par cover the sea.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. From utmost east to utmost west, 
\par where'er man's  foot hath trod,
\par By the mouth of many messengers 
\par goes forth the voice of God:
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Give ear to Me, ye continents-
\par ye isles, give ear to Me,
\par That the earth may be filled with 
\par the glory of God, as the waters 
\par cover the sea.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. What ca we do to work God's work, 
\par to prosper and increase
\par The brotherhood of all mankind- 
\par the reign of the prince of peace?
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par What can we do to hasten the time- 
\par the time that shall surely be,
\par When the earth shall be filled with 
\par the glory of God, as the waters 
\par cover the sea?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. March we forth in the strength of 
\par God, with the banner of Christ unfurled,
\par That the light of the glorious gospel 
\par of truth may shine throughout the world:
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Fight we the fight with sorrow and sin, 
\par to set their captives free,
\par That the earth may be filled with 
\par the glory of God, as the waters 
\par cover the sea.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. All we can do is nothing worth, 
\par unless God blesses  the deed;
\par Vainly we hope for the harest-
\par tide, till God gives life to the seed;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yet nearer and nearer draws the time- 
\par the time that shall surely be,
\par When the earth shall be filled with 
\par the glory of God, as the waters 
\par cover the sea.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

